('hampi-boulders-retreat',1,'Boulders Retreat Hampi','resort','Granite-view cottages with a quiet courtyard pool.','A low-slung property on the edge of the boulder fields, ten minutes from the Virupaksha temple gate. Rooms open onto a planted courtyard; breakfast is served under the tamarind trees.','/images/hampi.jpg',15.3410,76.4640,'Kamalapura Road, Hampi',4200,4.5,214,'["Free Wi-Fi","Breakfast included","Pool","Air conditioning","Airport transfer"]','14:00','11:00',24),
('tungabhadra-heritage-stay',1,'Tungabhadra Heritage Stay','heritage','A restored riverside house with stone walls and a shaded veranda.','Six rooms in a converted family home on the Hampi side of the river. The host runs morning heritage walks and can arrange coracle crossings.','/images/hampi.jpg',15.3350,76.4590,'Bazaar Street, Hampi',2600,4.3,132,'["Free Wi-Fi","Breakfast included","Garden","Pet friendly"]','13:00','10:00',6),
