('sandalwood-house',2,'Sandalwood House','boutique','A small boutique stay in a quiet residential lane.','Eight rooms around a frangipani courtyard, with filter coffee and a small library. Devaraja Market is a ten-minute walk.','/images/jaipur.jpg',12.3095,76.6510,'Lakshmipuram, Mysore',2900,4.6,168,'["Free Wi-Fi","Breakfast included","Library","Air conditioning"]','15:00','11:00',8),
('coorg-estate-cottages',3,'Coffee Estate Cottages','homestay','Plantation cottages with estate walks and home-cooked Kodava food.','Four cottages inside a working coffee estate near Madikeri. Rates include an estate walk and a Kodava dinner on request.','/images/coorg.jpg',12.3600,75.7900,'Madikeri Road, Coorg',4800,4.7,236,'["Free Wi-Fi","Breakfast included","Estate walk","Fireplace","Parking"]','13:00','11:00',6),
('misty-ridge-coorg',3,'Misty Ridge Coorg','resort','Valley-view rooms with a spa and an infinity pool.','Perched on a ridge above the Kaveri valley, with large windows and a heated pool. Good for a slow couple of days.','/images/coorg.jpg',12.4000,75.7500,'Kushalnagar Road, Coorg',6200,4.5,312,'["Free Wi-Fi","Breakfast included","Pool","Spa","Restaurant","Parking"]','14:00','11:00',30),
('chikmagalur-hill-crest',4,'Hill Crest Chikmagalur','homestay','A ridge-top homestay with sunrise views over the coffee hills.','A working estate home with four guest rooms and a large veranda. The host arranges jeep transfers to Mullayanagiri and Hebbe Falls.','/images/munnar.jpg',13.3300,75.7800,'Kaimara, Chikmagalur',3200,4.4,142,'["Free Wi-Fi","Breakfast included","Bonfire","Parking"]','13:00','10:00',4),
('gokarna-cliff-house',5,'Cliff House Gokarna','hotel','Simple rooms above Om Beach with sea-facing balconies.','A cliffside property with steps down to Om Beach. Rooms are plain but the balconies and the sound of the water are the point.','/images/goa.jpg',14.5210,74.3145,'Om Beach Road, Gokarna',2400,4.2,198,'["Free Wi-Fi","Restaurant","Sea view","Parking"]','12:00','10:00',18),
